{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37149","headline":"题菖蒲废观 · 许三畏","name":"题菖蒲废观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"本是安期烧药处，今来改作坐禅宫。\n数僧梵响满楼月，深谷猨声半夜风。\n金简事移松阁逈，彩云影散阆山空。\n我来不见修真客，却得真如问远公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许三畏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37149.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37149","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}